                        label: "Lua",
                        content: "# Lua Integration\n\nLogMark supports Lua scripting for dynamic content.\n\n## Usage\nCreate a code block with `lua` language:\n\n```lua\n-- Example\nlocal x = 10\nprint(\'Value:\', x)\ngraph.add_node(\'New Node\')\n```\n\n## Features\n- **Run**: Execute the script.\n- **Debug**: Inspect variables in the left sidebar.\n- **API**:\n  - `print(val)`: Print to output.\n  - `graph.add_node(\'label\')`: Create a node.\n  - `graph.add_edge(\'from\', \'to\', \'label\')`: Connect nodes.\n  - `graph.list_nodes()`: List all nodes.",
                    ),
